<title>MOROCCO: Morocco agrees to partly privatise telecom sector.</title>
<headline>Morocco agrees to partly privatise telecom sector.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco has agreed to partly privatise the telecommunications sector, including the GSM mobile telephone network, an official at the privatisation ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;After weeks of discussions, a draft law aimed at partly privatising the telecommunications sector was adopted by a government cabinet,&quot; the official told Reuters.</p>
</text>
